Modules whose behaviour follows LGPL mods (no source files were copied):

- Confirm Disconnect — https://codeberg.org/MicrocontrollersDev/Confirm-Disconnect
  LGPL-3.0 (MicrocontrollersDev). Replicated: asking before leaving a
  world or server (modules/misc/ConfirmDisconnect.java).
- Gamma Utils — https://github.com/Sjouwer/gamma-utils
  LGPL-3.0 (Sjouwer). Replicated: the gamma toggle, step and limit
  defaults, the coloured gamma message and the smooth transition
  (modules/render/Fullbright.java).
- Zoomify — https://github.com/isXander/Zoomify
  LGPL-3.0 (isXander). Replicated from its option list: separate zoom-in
  and zoom-out times and easing curves, scroll steps and a zoom limit,
  zoom-step keys, relative mouse sensitivity and view bobbing, cinematic
  camera while zoomed, the spyglass requirement, overlay and sounds, the
  secondary zoom that hides the HUD, and presets
  (modules/render/Zoom.java, mixin/zoom).
- SimpleWaypoints — https://github.com/xpple/SimpleWaypoints
  LGPL-3.0 (xpple). Replicated from its command and option list: adding,
  removing, renaming, moving, showing and hiding waypoints by command,
  importing another world's waypoints, and separate distance limits for
  labels and markers (waypoints/WaypointCommands.java,
  waypoints/WaypointStore.java, modules/misc/Waypoints.java,
  gui/WaypointsScreen.java).

