Modules whose idea follows GPL utility clients (behaviour only; no source
files were copied; combat, ESP, automation and movement features were left
out on purpose):

- Meteor Client — https://github.com/MeteorDevelopment/meteor-client
  GPL-3.0 (MeteorDevelopment). Followed from its module list: a reconnect
  button with an optional countdown on the disconnect screen
  (modules/misc/AutoReconnect.java), a notice when the server stops sending
  updates (modules/hud/ServerLag.java), container contents as a slot grid
  in tooltips (modules/render/ContainerPreview.java) and a longer chat
  history (modules/misc/ChatHistory.java, mixin/chat/ChatHistoryMixin.java).
- Wurst Client — https://github.com/Wurst-Imperium/Wurst7
  GPL-3.0 (Wurst-Imperium). Followed from its feature list: Reconnect and
  InfiniChat, the same two ideas as above.
